# Root the static camera data tree (cameras.json, <slug>/manifest.json, ...)
# is served from. Defaults to "/" (same-origin) — right for the normal
# deployment where this app's built dist/ is dropped at the Apache document
# root right next to the data tree caelum's uploader rsyncs there.
#
# Point this at a different host during development, e.g. a copy of the
# data tree served separately:
# VITE_REMOTE_BASE_URL=https://allsky.example.org/data/
VITE_REMOTE_BASE_URL=/
